ight Eyes*: it sees in darkness and has advantage on Perception."},{"name":"Flyby","text":"*Flyby*."}],"harvest":"Feathers.","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Prey and a quiet forest.","tactics":"Dives silently on the back rank, then it's gone.","tell":"none. Only a Perception check hears the wings.","exploit":"it hunts at night, and in bright daylight it has disadvantage on attacks.","type":"Beast","kind":"creature","order":17},{"id":"great-elk","name":"Great Elk","kr":3,"section":"Beasts","typeLine":"Beast","tags":[],"description":"An elk with antlers twelve feet wide. The stags will fight anything.","hp":34,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":6,"dex":11,"con":6,"int":17,"wis":10,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":17,"disengage":14,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Antlers","text":"Antlers: 2d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Charge","text":"*Charge*: move at least 20 ft in a straight line, then Antlers for 3d8, +1d2 prone.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"prone"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Rutting","text":"*Rutting*: in autumn, it attacks anything its size or bigger on sight."}],"harvest":"Antlers, hide, meat.","role":"Brute","wants":"Its herd safe, and its rival beaten.","tactics":"Charges and gores, and breaks off once the herd is safe.","tell":"it lowers its antlers.","exploit":"outside autumn, it only fights if the herd is threatened, so give the herd room.","type":"Beast","kind":"creature","order":18},{"id":"giant-vulture","name":"Giant Vulture","kr":3,"section":"Beasts","typeLine":"Beast, flier","tags":["flier"],"description":"A carrion bird as tall as a person that circles over the dying.","hp":30,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"10 ft, fly 60 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":9,"con":8,"int":17,"wis":8,"cha":17},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":12,"disengage":10,"casting":nul