: 1d6, and the target is grabbed. A grabbed target takes 1d6 each turn.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d6","1d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Undead","text":"*Undead*."},{"name":"Mindless","text":"*Mindless*."},{"name":"Tiny","text":"*Tiny*: attacks against it have disadvantage."}],"harvest":"None.","role":"Lurker","wants":"To strangle whoever its master named.","tactics":"Climbs up and drops onto a caster's throat.","tell":"fingers tapping on stone.","exploit":"pin it to the floor, and attacks against it get advantage.","type":"Undead","kind":"creature","order":34},{"id":"plague-corpse","name":"Plague Corpse","kr":2,"section":"Undead","typeLine":"Undead, mindless","tags":["mindless"],"description":"A bloated, weeping body that's more disease than flesh. Kill it from a distance.","hp":16,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":17,"con":null,"int":20,"wis":17,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":17,"disengage":17,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Slam","text":"Slam: 1d6, +2d2 disease.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d6"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"disease"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Undead","text":"*Undead*."},{"name":"Mindless","text":"*Mindless*."},{"name":"Burst","text":"*Burst*: when it dies, every creature within 10 ft makes a strength save or is poisoned for 1d4 turns and takes +1d2 disease. Killing it with fire burns the cloud away first."}],"harvest":"Plague bile (alchemy, handle with care).","role":"Brute","wants":"Nothing. It just walks.","tactics":"Walks into the thickest group and waits to be popped.","tell":"it swells and gurgles.","exploit":"ranged attacks or fire.","type":"Undead","kind":"creature","order":35},{"id":"skeletal-hound","name":"Skeletal Hound","kr":2,"section":"Undead","typeLine":"Undead, mindless","tags":["mindless"],"description":"The bones of a war dog, still trained to hunt.","hp":16,"hpNote":null,"defence":1