 a fight.","tactics":"Ambushes from cover with crossbows, then closes in on the weakest.","tell":"the road goes suspiciously quiet.","exploit":"bandits surrender once half of them are down, and most will happily take a toll instead.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":58},{"id":"cultist","name":"Cultist","kr":1,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, fanatic","tags":["fanatic"],"description":"A robed believer with a ritual knife and nothing left to lose.","hp":9,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":11,"con":12,"int":12,"wis":14,"cha":11},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":12},"attacks":[{"name":"Ritual dagger","text":"Ritual dagger: 1d6.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Fanatic","text":"*Fanatic*: it never checks morale while a Cult Priest lives, and has advantage on saves against fear."}],"harvest":"1d10 silver, a cult token.","role":"Soldier","wants":"Its god's favour.","tactics":"Crowds around to protect the priest.","tell":"chanting.","exploit":"kill the priest and they lose Fanatic.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":59},{"id":"thug","name":"Thug","kr":1,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, muscle","tags":["muscle"],"description":"Hired fists for gangs, debt collectors and anyone else who pays.","hp":12,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":8,"dex":13,"con":9,"int":15,"wis":13,"cha":13},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":14,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Cudgel","text":"Cudgel: 1d8, +1d2 stun.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"stun"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Gang Up","text":"*Gang Up*: advantage on attacks against a target another thug is standing next to."}],"harvest":"1d10 silver.","role":"Brute","wants":"To get paid.","tactics":"Several thugs gang up on one target.","tell":"cracking knuckles.","exploit":"they work for money, so outbid their boss.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":60},{"id":"town-guard","name":"Town Guard","kr":2,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, soldier","tags":["soldier"],"description":"A watch soldier with a spear, a shield and a whistle.","hp":16,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":2,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":11,"con":10,"int":12,"wis":11,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":9,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Spear","text":"Spear: reach 10 ft, 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Shield Wall","text":"*Shield Wall*: advantage on Dodge while standing next to another guard."},{"name":"Raise the Alarm","text":"*Raise the Alarm*: one whistle brings 1d4 more guards in 1d4 turns."}],"harvest":"1d10 silver, spear, shield.","role":"Soldier","wants":"Order, and to finish their shift.","tactics":"Forms a shield wall and blows the whistle.","tell":"the whistle.","exploit":"guards arrest rather than kill, and many take bribes.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":61},{"id":"corsair","name":"Corsair","kr":2,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, pirate","tags":["pirate"],"description":"A deck-hardened raider who fights dirty and swings in on the rigging.","hp":15,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"30 ft, swim 30 ft","stats":{"str":10,"dex":8,"con":10,"int":13,"wis":12,"cha":11},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":9,"dodge":12,"disengage":9,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Cutlass","text":"Cutlass: 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Thrown knife","text":"Thrown knife: range 30 ft, 1d6.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boarding Swing","text":"*Boarding Swing*: it can move 30 ft by rope or rigging without being attacked on the way, and its next attack has advantage."},{"name":"Dirty Trick","text":"*Dirty Trick* (once per combat): sand in the eyes, and the target makes a DEX save or is blinded for 1 turn."},{"name":"Sea Legs","text":"*Sea Legs*: no penalties on a pitching deck."}],"harvest":"2d10 silver, cutlass.","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Loot.","tactics":"Swings in, plays a dirty trick, grabs what it can and runs.","tell":"grappling hooks thud into the rail.","exploit":"cut the boarding lines.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":62},{"id":"scout","name":"Scout","kr":2,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, ranger","tags":["ranger"],"description":"A tracker and lookout who would rather shoot from cover than fight in the open.","hp":15,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"35 ft","stats":{"str":11,"dex":7,"con":11,"int":11,"wis":7,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":10,"ranged":8,"dodge":14,"disengage":10,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Longbow","text":"Longbow: range 150 ft, 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Shortsword","text":"Shortsword: 1d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Keen Eyes","text":"*Keen Eyes*: advantage on Perception."},{"name":"Skirmisher","text":"*Skirmisher*: after a bow attack, it can move 10 ft for free."}],"harvest":"Longbow, 1d10 silver.","role":"Artillery","wants":"To get back and report.","tactics":"Shoots, falls back, and runs to warn the others.","tell":"birdcalls passed between scouts.","exploit":"catch it before it gets away and no reinforcements come.","type":"Humanoid","kind":"creature","order":63},{"id":"spy","name":"Spy","kr":3,"section":"Humanoids","typeLine":"Humanoid, infiltrator","tags":["infiltrator"],"description":"A pleasant face, a false name and a poisoned blade.","hp":22,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":7,"con":11,"int":7,"wis":8,"cha":6},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":8,"dodge