rted junk.","role":"Brute","wants":"Food and treasure.","tactics":"Swings at whoever is nearest.","tell":"it winds the club back before a Sweep.","exploit":"it's easy to trick.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":85},{"id":"gargoyle","name":"Gargoyle","kr":8,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, living stone","tags":["living stone"],"description":"It perches on rooftops and ruins and sits perfectly still until someone walks underneath.","hp":55,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"30 ft, fly 60 ft","stats":{"str":6,"dex":9,"con":5,"int":14,"wis":9,"cha":16},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":11,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 1d10 each, and Bite 1d8.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10","1d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Stone Still","text":"*Stone Still*: while it doesn't move, it can't be told apart from a statue, and it has advantage on every attack in the first round of combat."},{"name":"Stoneskin","text":"*Stoneskin*: bludgeoning ignores its Min hit."}],"harvest":"Living stone (crafting and runework).","role":"Lurker","wants":"Its perch to itself.","tactics":"Ambushes from its perch, then flies up to dive again.","tell":"a statue that wasn't there yesterday.","exploit":"bludgeoning, and keep it on the ground.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":86},{"id":"yeti","name":"Yeti","kr":8,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous","tags":[],"description":"A white-furred mountain brute that hunts in blizzards.","hp":75,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":2,"speed":"40 ft, climb 40 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":10,"con":5,"int":15,"wis":9,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 1d12 each, +1d2 freeze.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d12"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"freeze"}]},{"name":"Chilling Gaze","text":"*Chilling Gaze* (3-turn recharge): one target within 30 ft makes a strength save or takes +2d2 freeze.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"freeze"}]}],"traits":[{"name":null,"text":"Immune to cold, and weak to fire."},{"name":"Snow Camouflage","text":"*Snow Camouflage*: advantage on Stealth in snow."}],"harvest":"White pelt (cold-proof).","role":"Brute","wants":"Food in a frozen land.","tactics":"Attacks in a blizzard and freezes one target solid.","tell":"a howl carried on the wind.","exploit":"fire.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":87},{"id":"griffin","name":"Griffin","kr":10,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, flier","tags":["flier"],"description":"An eagle's head and wings on a lion's body. It's proud and fierce, but can be tamed if it's raised from an egg.","hp":90,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":2,"speed":"30 ft, fly 80 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":6,"con":6,"int":15,"wis":7,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Beak 2d8 and Claws 2d8.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8","2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Dive","text":"*Dive* (as Giant Eagle).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"as Giant Eagle","damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Keen Sight","text":"*Keen Sight*."},{"name":"Flyby","text":"*Flyby*."}],"harvest":"Feathers. An egg can be raised as a mount and is worth a fortune.","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Horse meat, and its nest safe.","tactics":"Dives, grabs and drops.","tell":"a screech from above.","exploit":"a horse lures it in, and it can be tamed.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":88},{"id":"basilisk","name":"Basilisk","kr":16,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, reptile","tags":["reptile"],"description":"A low, eight-legged lizard. Its eyes turn flesh to stone.","hp":120,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":14,"con":5,"int":18,"wis":10,"cha":17},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":15,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 2d10, +2d2 poison, with advantage against a restrained target.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"poison"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Petrifying Gaze","text":"*Petrifying Gaze*: any creature that starts its turn within 30 ft and can see the basilisk's eyes makes a strength save. The first fail leaves it restrained as it stiffens, and a second fail in a row turns it to stone. Averting your eyes avoids the gaze, but gives disadvantage on attacks against it."},{"name":"Reflection","text":"*Reflection*: if the basilisk sees its own gaze in a mirror, it has to make the save too."}],"harvest":"Eyes (petrification reagent), blood (reverses petrification).","role":"Solo","wants":"A quiet cave, full of statues.","tactics":"Gazes first, then bites whoever is restrained.","tell":"its eyes start to glow.","exploit":"mirrors, blindfolds, or fighting with your eyes shut.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":89},{"id":"werewolf","name":"Werewolf","kr":18,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, cursed","tags":["cursed"],"description":"A person by day and a hulking wolf-beast under the full moon. The bite spreads the curse.","hp":130,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":0,"speed":"40 ft (50 ft on all fours)","stats":{"str":4,"dex":6,"con":5,"int":12,"wis":8,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":9,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 1d12 each, and Bite 2d10. A humanoid it bites makes a strength save or is cursed, and turns at the next full moon.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d12","2d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Regeneration","text":"*Regeneration*: it heals 10 HP a turn."},{"name":"Silver and Light","text":"*Silver and Light*: only silver weapons or light magic can take it below 1 HP, and either one stops its regeneration for a turn."},{"name":"Keen Nose","text":"*Keen Nose*."}],"harvest":"Pelt, and the cure if it's taken alive (the DM decides what that is).","role":"Solo","wants":"Not to be a monster (the person), or to hunt (the wolf).","tactics":"Hunts whoever is alone, and pulls back to regenerate.","tell":"it snarls as the change takes hold.","exploit":"silver and light. By day it's just a person.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":90},{"id":"troll","name":"Troll","kr":20,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, giant-kin","tags":["giant-kin"],"description":"Long-armed, green-grey and rubbery. Cut it apart and the pieces try to crawl back together.","hp":160,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":12,"con":3,"int":16,"wis":12,"cha":17},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 2d8 each, and Bite 2d8.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8","2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Regeneration","text":"*Regeneration*: it heals 15 HP a turn unless it took fire or acid damage since its last turn. If it's on 0 HP when it regenerates, it gets back up. Severed limbs grow back on its next turn."}],"harvest":"Troll blood (healing potions).","role":"Solo","wants":"Food.","tactics":"Charges in, tears at people, and keeps getting back up.","tell":"it sniffs the air before it charges.","exploit":"fire and acid.","type":"Monstrous","kind":"creature","order":91},{"id":"wyvern","name":"Wyvern","kr":22,"section":"Monstrous","typeLine":"Monstrous, draconic","tags":["draconic"],"description":"A two-legged drake with a venomous tail. It has no flavour, no breath and no true dragon's mind, only hunger.","hp":180,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"20 ft, fly 80 ft","stats":{"s