:"Drowning Ride","text":"*Drowning Ride*: a creature that touches or mounts it is stuck, and pulling free takes a strength save at disadvantage. It gallops into the water, and the stuck creature can't breathe.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Fey","text":"*Fey*."},{"name":"Amphibious","text":"*Amphibious*."},{"name":"Shapechanger","text":"*Shapechanger*: horse or human."}],"harvest":"Its bridle. A kelpie forced into a bridle has to serve.","role":"Lurker","wants":"A rider to drown.","tactics":"Lures a rider onto its back, then bolts for the water.","tell":"a dripping wet mane on a dry day.","exploit":"get a bridle on it.","type":"Fey","kind":"creature","order":141},{"id":"spriggan","name":"Spriggan","kr":10,"section":"Fey","typeLine":"Fey","tags":[],"description":"A gnarled guardian of fairy treasure that swells to giant size when it's angry.","hp":85,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":3,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":6,"dex":8,"con":6,"int":11,"wis":8,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":15,"disengage":14,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Club","text":"Club: 2d10, or 3d10 while it's giant.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10","3d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Fey","text":"*Fey*."},{"name":"Swell","text":"*Swell*: as a bonus action, it grows to giant size for 1d4 turns, gaining reach 15 ft and 40 temp HP."}],"harvest":"Fairy treasure (2d10 gold). Roll 1d2, and on a 2 it turns to leaves by morning.","role":"Brute","wants":"Its treasure kept safe.","tactics":"Swells to giant size and smashes.","tell":"it starts to grow.","exploit":"give the treasure back.","type":"Fey","kind":"creature","order":142},{"id":"hag","name":"Hag","kr":18,"section":"Fey","typeLine":"Fey","tags":[],"description":"A crone as old as the forest she lives in. She trades curses for secrets, and the other way round.","hp":150,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":3,"speed":"30 ft","stats