","text":"*Spore Burst* (2-turn recharge): everyone within 30 ft makes a strength save or takes 5d10 poison and +2d2 disease. Anything it kills rises as a Spore Walker.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["5d10"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"disease"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Plant","text":"*Plant*."},{"name":"Regeneration","text":"*Regeneration*: 10 HP a turn, unless it took fire damage since its last turn."}],"harvest":"Rare mushrooms.","role":"Brute","wants":"To spread.","tactics":"Smashes, and bursts spores over anyone who gathers.","tell":"the spore sacs on its back swell.","exploit":"fire.","type":"Plant","kind":"creature","order":163},{"id":"oak-warden","name":"Oak Warden","kr":42,"section":"Plants","typeLine":"Plant","tags":[],"description":"An ancient tree that walks and guards its forest. It's slow to anger and terrible once it is.","hp":380,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":7,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":17,"con":2,"int":8,"wis":3,"cha":8},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":6,"dodge":17,"disengage":17,"casting":4},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Slam ×2, 3d12 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Hurled log","text":"Hurled log: range 90 ft, 4d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Root Hold","text":"*Root Hold*: everyone within 30 ft makes a strength save or is restrained.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Plant","text":"*Plant*."},{"name":"Awaken Trees","text":"*Awaken Trees* (once a day): two trees within 60 ft wake up and fight as Thorn Shamblers."}],"harvest":"Heartwood (staff crafting). Taking it angers the whole forest.","role":"Solo","wants":"Its forest protected.","tactics":"Wakes the trees, holds intruders with roots, and crushes them.","tell":"leaves rustle when there's no wind.","exploit":"it's on the side of good, so talk to it.","type":"Plant","kind":"creature","order":164},{"id":"elder-grove","name":"Elder Grove","kr":150,"section":"Plants","typeLine":"Plant","tags":[],"description":"A whole ancient forest that is a single living mind. When it wakes, the trees walk.","hp":1500,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":11,"speed":"10 ft (it moves as the forest grows)","stats":{"str":1,"dex":20,"con":1,"int":3,"wis":1,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":20,"disengage":null,"casting":1},"attacks":[{"name":"Root Storm","text":"*Root Storm* (2-turn recharge): everyone within 120 ft makes a STR save or takes 12d10 and is restrained.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["12d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Wake the Trees","text":"*Wake the Trees*: each turn, 1d4 trees inside it attack as Thorn Shamblers.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Plant","text":"*Plant*."},{"name":"Spellcasting","text":"*Spellcasting*: tiers 1–9 of the life school."},{"name":"Grove's Tempo","text":"*Grove's Tempo*: it acts three times a round."},{"name":"The Forest Is the Body","text":"*The Forest Is the Body*: it can only be damaged at its heart tree. Anywhere else, the forest simply regrows."}],"harvest":"The grove heart (a legendary life-school core).","role":"Set piece","wants":"The forest to last for ever.","tactics":"The whole forest is the enemy. The fight is a journey to the heart tree.","tell":"the birds fall silent.","exploit":"find the heart tree.","type":"Plant","kind":"creature","order":165},{"id":"jellyfish-bloom","name":"Jellyfish Bloom","kr":2,"section":"Sea creatures","typeLine":"Beast, swarm, aquatic","tags":["swarm","aquatic"],"description":"A drifting mass of stinging jellyfish.","hp":14,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"swim 15 ft","stats":{"str":18,"dex":16,"con":12,"int":20,"wis":16,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":16,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Stings",