ss certain reefs.","type":"Sea","kind":"creature","order":176},{"id":"abyssal-squid","name":"Abyssal Squid","kr":80,"section":"Sea creatures","typeLine":"Monstrous, aquatic","tags":["aquatic"],"description":"A ship-dragging horror from the deep trenches, big enough to darken the sea.","hp":750,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":8,"speed":"swim 80 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":7,"con":1,"int":10,"wis":6,"cha":16},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":null},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Tentacles ×4, reach 40 ft, 2d10 each, and the target is grabbed. A tentacle is severed after 80 damage, which also comes off the squid's HP.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Beak on a grabbed target","text":"Beak on a grabbed target: 5d12.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d12"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Squid's Tempo","text":"*Squid's Tempo*: it acts twice a round."},{"name":"Ink Night","text":"*Ink Night* (once per combat): the water and the surface within 300 ft go pitch dark."},{"name":"Whirlpool","text":"*Whirlpool*: each round, every ship within 300 ft is dragged 30 ft towards it."}],"harvest":"Beak, ink, hide.","role":"Solo","wants":"Ships pulled down, and the surface dark.","tactics":"Pulls ships in with its whirlpool, grabs crew and feeds them to its beak.","tell":"ink rises around the ship.","exploit":"sever the tentacles, and it hates bright light.","type":"Sea","kind":"creature","order":177},{"id":"trench-titan","name":"Trench Titan","kr":250,"section":"Sea creatures","typeLine":"Monstrous, aquatic","tags":["aquatic"],"description":"A creature of the deepest trenches, bigger than any island, that only surfaces to end fleets.","hp":2600,"hpNote":null,"defence":7,"minHit":13,"speed":"swim 100 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":8,"con":1,"int":8,"wis":3,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":14,"casting":null},"atta