lcasting*: tiers 1–4 of its flavour."},{"name":"Signature Move","text":"*Signature Move*: its flavour's Adult move (see Signature moves)."},{"name":"Lair","text":"*Lair*: inside its lair, the flavour's lair effect is always active."}],"harvest":"Scales (armour), teeth, horns, flavour gland, its hoard.","role":"Solo","wants":"Its territory respected, and its hoard to grow.","tactics":"Fights from the air, breathes on anyone bunched together, and lands to finish off the wounded.","tell":"as Juvenile.","exploit":"its flavour's weakness. Draw it out of its lair to lose the lair effect. A benevolent one would rather bargain.","type":"Dragon","kind":"tier","family":"dragon","tier":"Adult","tierNumber":2,"order":191},{"id":"elder-dragon","name":"Elder Dragon","kr":160,"section":"Dragons","typeLine":"Dragon","tags":[],"description":"Centuries old and the size of a keep. Elders rule rather than just hunt.","hp":1600,"hpNote":null,"defence":6,"minHit":10,"speed":"40 ft, fly 100 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":6,"con":2,"int":4,"wis":4,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":3,"dodge":11,"disengage":9,"casting":3},"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 3d20, +3d2 flavour status, and Claws ×2, 3d12 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d20","3d12"],"status":[{"dice":"3d2","n":3,"status":"flavour status"}]},{"name":"Tail","text":"Tail: reach 25 ft, 3d12, +2d2 prone.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d12"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"prone"}]},{"name":"Wing Buffet","text":"*Wing Buffet*: everyone within 15 ft takes 2d12 and is knocked prone, and the dragon can fly half its speed without being attacked.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Breath","text":"*Breath* (2-turn recharge): a 120 ft cone, 15d10, +6d2 flavour status. A Dodge roll halves the damage.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["15d10"],"status":[{"dice":"6d2","n"